Law texts

The texts in this repository are Laws of Nasarawa State, taken from the copies the Nasarawa State Government publishes at
nasarawastate.gov.ng (Laws as published in the State Gazette).

- Copyright: the Copyright Act, 2022 (Nigeria), s. 3, says: "The following shall not be eligible for copyright -- ...
  (b) official texts of a legislative or administrative nature as well as any official translations, except their
  compilations". The Laws here are such official texts. Any general copyright notice on the website does not reach
  texts that are not eligible for copyright; no compilation of the Government's is copied.
- The Government's PDFs are not the authoritative text: the Laws as published in the Nasarawa State of Nigeria Gazette are.

Attribution: Source: Nasarawa State Government, https://nasarawastate.gov.ng.

Everything else (the git history's structure, the tools and the documentation): CC0 1.0 Universal,
